{
    "title": "ClearVPN - Fast & Secure VPN",
    "description": "ClearVPN is a hassle-free and fast VPN for those who want to expand and secure their online experience. Just one tap in your VPN app, and you\u2019re fully protected, as ClearVPN ensures all your traffic is private while maintaining fast internet speed.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffbWith ClearVPN you can:\r\n\u2705 Enjoy secure browsing \u2013 hide IP address and spice it with DNS protection\r\n\u2705 Change IP location by picking one of 45+ countries and connecting to its servers\r\n\u2705 Connect to different cities within countries\r\n\u2705 Connect to the fastest servers automatically\r\n\u2705 Block ads in-app or with our free browser extension\r\n\u2705 Explore local online content\r\n\u2705 Explore more content with expanded streaming access\r\n\u2705 Enjoy VPN on up to 6 devices\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb EFFORTLESS\r\nYou don\u2019t need to dive into the online security world to use ClearVPN. Just turn on the VPN for better protection or decide to change location digitally \u2013 and we will do the rest. One tap, and you're clear to go!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb SMOOTH & BEAUTIFUL\r\nClearVPN is the VPN you\u2019ll love using. It\u2019s intuitive, beautiful, fast, and requires no extra tech skills. Aside from being a practical daily digital helper, it\u2019s just a pleasure to switch that colorful button on and continue with your tasks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb PRIVATE & SECURE\r\nIt\u2019s not just about good looks \u2013 it\u2019s about your online safety and privacy. ClearVPN uses AES-256 encryption. To eliminate any security vulnerabilities and achieve a high-speed connection even while using public Wi-Fi, the app relies on its own custom protocol and IPSec IKEV2 and OpenVPN. Browse, play, stream, or communicate without any tracking from the ISPs. Additionally, we have a no-log policy. We don't store, share, or even collect users' online activity, personal info, IP address, etc.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffbMADE IN UKRAINE \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6\r\nClearVPN is proudly Ukrainian\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6. It\u2019s developed and supported by a team of brave Ukrainians doing their job in the middle of an invasion.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb BENEFITS OF PREMIUM\r\n\u2714 Connect VPN on up to 6 devices with one Premium subscription.\r\n\u2714 Encrypt all your interactions with top-tier algorithms.\r\n\u2714 Choose any of the 45+ countries to connect to its servers and change your IP location.\r\n\u2714 Don\u2019t bother picking servers \u2013 let us connect you to an optimal location automatically.\r\n\u2714 Sort countries for less web restrictions, stricter privacy laws, and more.\r\n\u2714 Enjoy a better streaming experience\r\n\u2714 Advanced ad-blocking and traffic filtering in our browser extension\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb PREMIUM SUBSCRIPTION\r\n\u2705 Renews automatically.\r\n\u2705 You will be charged for subscription renewal 24 hours before your current subscription period ends.\r\n\u2705 You can manage your subscriptions by going to the user's Account Settings after the purchase.\r\n\u2705 If you cancel the renewal, your subscription will remain active until the end of your current cycle and then deactivate automatically.\r\n\r\nLearn more about how we work:\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://clearvpn.com/privacy-policy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://clearvpn.com/terms-of-service/",
    "descriptionHTML": "ClearVPN is a hassle-free and fast VPN for those who want to expand and secure their online experience. Just one tap in your VPN app, and you\u2019re fully protected, as ClearVPN ensures all your traffic is private while maintaining fast internet speed.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffbWith ClearVPN you can:<br>\u2705 Enjoy secure browsing \u2013 hide IP address and spice it with DNS protection<br>\u2705 Change IP location by picking one of 45+ countries and connecting to its servers<br>\u2705 Connect to different cities within countries<br>\u2705 Connect to the fastest servers automatically<br>\u2705 Block ads in-app or with our free browser extension<br>\u2705 Explore local online content<br>\u2705 Explore more content with expanded streaming access<br>\u2705 Enjoy VPN on up to 6 devices<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb EFFORTLESS<br>You don\u2019t need to dive into the online security world to use ClearVPN. Just turn on the VPN for better protection or decide to change location digitally \u2013 and we will do the rest. One tap, and you&#39;re clear to go!<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb SMOOTH &amp; BEAUTIFUL<br>ClearVPN is the VPN you\u2019ll love using. It\u2019s intuitive, beautiful, fast, and requires no extra tech skills. Aside from being a practical daily digital helper, it\u2019s just a pleasure to switch that colorful button on and continue with your tasks.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb PRIVATE &amp; SECURE<br>It\u2019s not just about good looks \u2013 it\u2019s about your online safety and privacy. ClearVPN uses AES-256 encryption. To eliminate any security vulnerabilities and achieve a high-speed connection even while using public Wi-Fi, the app relies on its own custom protocol and IPSec IKEV2 and OpenVPN. Browse, play, stream, or communicate without any tracking from the ISPs. Additionally, we have a no-log policy. We don&#39;t store, share, or even collect users&#39; online activity, personal info, IP address, etc.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffbMADE IN UKRAINE \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6<br>ClearVPN is proudly Ukrainian\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6. It\u2019s developed and supported by a team of brave Ukrainians doing their job in the middle of an invasion.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb BENEFITS OF PREMIUM<br>\u2714 Connect VPN on up to 6 devices with one Premium subscription.<br>\u2714 Encrypt all your interactions with top-tier algorithms.<br>\u2714 Choose any of the 45+ countries to connect to its servers and change your IP location.<br>\u2714 Don\u2019t bother picking servers \u2013 let us connect you to an optimal location automatically.<br>\u2714 Sort countries for less web restrictions, stricter privacy laws, and more.<br>\u2714 Enjoy a better streaming experience<br>\u2714 Advanced ad-blocking and traffic filtering in our browser extension<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb PREMIUM SUBSCRIPTION<br>\u2705 Renews automatically.<br>\u2705 You will be charged for subscription renewal 24 hours before your current subscription period ends.<br>\u2705 You can manage your subscriptions by going to the user&#39;s Account Settings after the purchase.<br>\u2705 If you cancel the renewal, your subscription will remain active until the end of your current cycle and then deactivate automatically.<br><br>Learn more about how we work:<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://clearvpn.com/privacy-policy/<br>Terms of Use: https://clearvpn.com/terms-of-service/",
